---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Reviews" description="Our story and guest reviews for Carlton Ridge, Barbados.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Guest voices</p>
      <h1>Reviews</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-sand">
    <div class="wrap story">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>For the past 15 years, Barbados has been a special place for our family. We’ve come back for its beautiful beaches, warm and welcoming people, and the easy rhythm of island life.</p>
      <p>In summer 2026, we were privilege to be able to purchase Carlton Ridge as our holiday home. Now, as we prepare for its inaugural rental season, we’re looking forward to welcoming our first guests and for them to experience a place that means so much to us.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero { background: var(--navy); padding: 6rem 0 3rem; color: var(--white); }
  .page-hero__content h1 { color: var(--white); }

  .story { max-width: 780px; }
  .story h2 { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .story p { color: var(--navy-soft); line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 1rem; }
</style>
